00:18:11,063 --> 00:18:11,243
[SPEAKER_01]: No?

208
00:18:12,144 --> 00:18:21,713
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay, then I'll take a motion to lift the demo delay here if somebody would like to make one.

209
00:18:26,157 --> 00:18:39,641
[SPEAKER_03]: I'll make a motion to lift the demolition delay pending uploading the final agreed upon plans of taking out that window or whatever it was.

210
00:18:43,423 --> 00:18:51,285
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, I think Ryan was going to do that and then we'll ask the homeowner just to upload those in citizen serve and then we'll be able to release everything.

