213
00:19:03,671 --> 00:19:04,372
[SPEAKER_01]: Is there a second?

214
00:19:04,392 --> 00:19:06,754
[SPEAKER_01]: I'll second.

215
00:19:07,154 --> 00:19:07,714
[SPEAKER_01]: Thank you, Kit.

216
00:19:09,355 --> 00:19:11,697
