223
00:19:27,768 --> 00:19:31,191
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes or no to lift the demo delay at 130 Boston Avenue?

224
00:19:31,371 --> 00:19:31,631
[SPEAKER_02]: Yes.

225
00:19:32,492 --> 00:19:33,353
[SPEAKER_01]: Thank you, Ryan.

226
00:19:33,773 --> 00:19:34,073
[SPEAKER_04]: Yes.

