264
00:21:38,791 --> 00:21:39,151
[SPEAKER_08]: Correct.

265
00:21:40,202 --> 00:21:43,765
[SPEAKER_01]: Then version 2 is after discussion with the property owner.

266
00:21:43,966 --> 00:21:44,586
[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah.

267
00:21:44,606 --> 00:21:45,867
[SPEAKER_08]: This is version 2.

268
00:21:51,412 --> 00:22:01,721
[SPEAKER_03]: We were trying to talk to them about changing the roofline to make it look more like the original.

269
00:22:02,402 --> 00:22:05,805
