1048
01:15:24,894 --> 01:15:37,980
[SPEAKER_04]: Folks should be aware that this, the West Medford Community Survey was the first survey we did back in 2011, when we first started doing survey projects.

1049
01:15:38,743 --> 01:15:48,165
[SPEAKER_04]: This building was included as part of the African American neighborhood context was Medford was settled by a large number of African American.

1050
01:15:51,269 --> 01:16:01,776
[SPEAKER_04]: Americans who immigrated down from Canada, and they established a diverse neighborhood spanning most of South of High Street in what is traditionally called the Smith Estate.

1051
01:16:02,336 --> 01:16:06,879
[SPEAKER_04]: And of those, the big players are Moses Mann and his father-in-law Samuel Holton.

1052
01:16:07,399 --> 01:16:15,124
[SPEAKER_04]: And those folks, Moses Mann and Samuel Holton, were involved with the original creation of the church building back in the 1870s.

1053
01:16:15,925 --> 01:16:20,668
[SPEAKER_04]: And when they outgrew the original church, they built the wonderful building that's there today,

1054
01:16:21,863 --> 01:16:26,330
[SPEAKER_04]: And that congregation time merged with three others.

1055
01:16:29,513 --> 01:16:34,037
[SPEAKER_04]: the 1960s, and then sold out to Shiloh Baptist Church, who's owned the building since then.

1056
01:16:34,057 --> 01:16:37,300
[SPEAKER_04]: So Shiloh Baptist, there's two inventory forms if you go into Macris.

1057
01:16:37,340 --> 01:16:52,094
[SPEAKER_04]: There's the original little chapel building, which is a cute little structure, but it's now residential, and then there's this intricate church building, which has both a mix of architects and designers that kind of give it its weird, unique feature.

1058
01:16:53,275 --> 01:16:59,259
[SPEAKER_04]: The one thing that I would love to see restored as part of this building is the steeple.

1059
01:16:59,339 --> 01:17:04,502
[SPEAKER_04]: The steeple has been missing for a number of years.

1060
01:17:05,242 --> 01:17:08,544
[SPEAKER_04]: It's just trunicated at the top now, but the inventory forms

1061
01:17:09,208 --> 01:17:11,990
